WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:01.480
- So, what do you each remember

00:00:01.480 --> 00:00:04.580
from like the very first time
that y'all played together?

00:00:04.580 --> 00:00:05.870
Was it like awkward

00:00:05.870 --> 00:00:08.610
or like you knew right
away it was gonna work?

00:00:08.610 --> 00:00:11.990
- Well, Natalie had joined
the band, a previous lineup,

00:00:11.990 --> 00:00:14.877
and so Martie and I were
very, like, nervous, like,

00:00:14.877 --> 00:00:17.290
"Well, she rehearsed all the
songs and knew all the songs."

00:00:17.290 --> 00:00:18.973
Natalie was just like,
"Oh, I've got this, y'all."

00:00:18.973 --> 00:00:19.806
(laughing)

00:00:19.806 --> 00:00:20.770
She had this confidence

00:00:20.770 --> 00:00:21.987
and Martie and I were just like,

00:00:21.987 --> 00:00:22.928
"Oh my gosh, oh my gosh,"

00:00:22.928 --> 00:00:25.760
but Natalie brought this humongous pad

00:00:25.760 --> 00:00:27.150
with her lyrics on it.

00:00:27.150 --> 00:00:29.043
and we'd just flip it in between songs.

00:00:29.043 --> 00:00:31.820
- We played these two
clubs outside of Houston.

00:00:31.820 --> 00:00:32.974
- Yeah.
- And I was just...

00:00:32.974 --> 00:00:34.750
(laughing)

00:00:34.750 --> 00:00:36.738
- Next.
- Bend down, turn the page.

00:00:36.738 --> 00:00:37.680
(laughing)
- Oh my God,

00:00:37.680 --> 00:00:38.780
do you have a problem with lyrics?

00:00:38.780 --> 00:00:39.990
I do.
- No, but I had

00:00:39.990 --> 00:00:42.399
to learn 22 songs in seven days.

00:00:42.399 --> 00:00:45.320
I would just listen with headphones and...

00:00:45.320 --> 00:00:46.628
- And learned to yodel.
- Walk around.

00:00:46.628 --> 00:00:48.623
- I had never yodeled before.

00:00:48.623 --> 00:00:49.910
(laughing)

00:00:49.910 --> 00:00:51.850
That's a lot.
- I know.

00:00:51.850 --> 00:00:52.953
- Oh my gosh.

